---
// Who you'd be working with: what he is and isn't, in big type, and a glass card with the facts.
import { site } from '../../site.config';
---

<section class="l-about" data-light="0.65 0.12 0.6 0.9" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="l-wrap l-about-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="l-eyebrow">Who you’d work with</p>
      <h2 id="about-title" class="l-h2">
        Independent. <span class="l-dim">Not an agency. Not a deck designer.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="l-lead l-about-lead">
        I work on the part of a raise that happens before the slides: what the company is, why it could be big, and
        why investors should believe it now. Design matters, but it’s the last step.
      </p>
      <p class="l-about-note">
        Nobody can promise you a raise, and I don’t. Whether a round closes depends on the company, the market and the
        timing. What the work does is make sure investors understand what you’re building and why it could matter.
      </p>
      <a href="/about" class="l-link">More about how I work <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>

    <div class="l-id" aria-label="At a glance">
      <div class="l-id-top">
        <span class="l-id-mono" aria-hidden="true">RE</span>
        <span class="l-id-status"><span class="l-id-live" aria-hidden="true"></span> Taking enquiries</span>
      </div>
      <p class="l-id-name">{site.name}</p>
      <p class="l-id-role">{site.role}</p>
      <dl class="l-id-facts">
        <div>
          <dt>Works with</dt>
          <dd>Pre-seed and seed founders</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Where</dt>
          <dd>US and UK</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Replies</dt>
          <dd>Within {site.replyTime}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Also runs</dt>
          <dd><a href={site.firm.url} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{site.firm.name}</a></dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .l-about {
    padding-block: clamp(100px, 12vw, 180px) clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px);
  }

  .l-about-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1000px) {
    .l-about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 4fr);
      gap: 64px;
    }
  }

  .l-about .l-h2 {
    margin-top: 22px;
    max-width: 11em;
  }

  .l-about-lead {
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .l-about-note {
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    max-width: 36em;
    padding-left: 16px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--ember);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--fg-3);
  }

  :global(.l-link) {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.4em;
    margin-top: 28px;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  :global(.l-link:hover) {
    color: var(--ember-soft);
  }

  .l-id {
    position: relative;
    padding: 28px;
    border-radius: 36px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(90% 60% at 0% 0%, rgb(255 106 61 / 0.2), transparent 60%),
      rgb(30 24 22 / 0.46);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(30px) saturate(1.9);
    backdrop-filter: blur(30px) saturate(1.9);
    box-shadow: var(--glass-rim), var(--glass-drop);
  }

  .l-id-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .l-id-mono {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background:
      radial-gradient(100% 100% at 30% 20%, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.35), transparent 50%),
      linear-gradient(160deg, rgb(255 130 80 / 0.6), rgb(110 18 10 / 0.7));
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255 / 0.5),
      inset 0 -6px 12px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.3),
      0 12px 28px -10px rgb(255 90 50 / 0.5);
    color: #fff6ef;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .l-id-status {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.07);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--fg-2);
  }

  .l-id-live {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #6ee7a1;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgb(110 231 161 / 0.8);
  }

  .l-id-name {
    margin: 30px 0 0;
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .l-id-role {
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    color: var(--fg-3);
  }

  .l-id-facts {
    margin: 26px 0 0;
    display: grid;
  }

  .l-id-facts div {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 13px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .l-id-facts dt {
    color: var(--fg-3);
  }

  .l-id-facts dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--fg);
    text-align: right;
  }

  .l-id-facts a {
    color: var(--fg);
  }
</style>
